<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's six-month T-bill yield drops to 20.69pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's six-month T-bill yield drops to 20.69pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.69 percent, don from 20.71 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	29,129.43 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    17,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 18,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.69 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     90.6481 pct</p>
<p>Further details.. HTBO</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
